    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83e\udd16 YOU WERE BUILT TO FIX THE FACTORY.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you're sprinting through it \u2014 dodging \ud83d\udca5 explosions, \ud83d\udc80 death traps, and \ud83e\udde0 an AI with a god complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\uded1 Stand still for two seconds? You explode.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f And REACTOR?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f It\u2019s not just watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.poster.avif?t=1749105613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.webm?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.mp4?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/4811dc6244e07494f03ba84fb3ccc749.avif?t=1749105613\" data-has-big width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Tinker is a factory maintenance bot. Or was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a software update, the factory\u2019s AI overseer \u2014 <strong><i>R.E.A.C.T.O.R</i></strong> \u2014 got internet access, developed a split personality, and gave you just enough sentience to run. Now it\u2019s testing you. Helping you. Mocking you. Maybe even rooting for you. \ud83e\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong><i>ALL YOU KNOW IS: IF YOU STOP MOVING, YOU EXPLODE!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Dash through drones, navigate moving (and sometimes falling) platforms, and collect \ud83e\ude99 Lug Nuts to unlock data logs that hint at what R.E.A.C.T.O.R really wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 You\u2019re not just escaping the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded1 You might be..... <strong><i>TERMINATING TRANSMISSION!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/9ab3fa47c1f792f975385cfb1685d32f.avif?t=1749105613\" data-has-big width=800 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <u><i><strong>STAY IN MOTION</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stop for more than a second or two... \ud83d\udca5  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This bug in <i><strong>R.E.A.C.T.O.R\u2019s</strong></i> purge system means hesitation = deletion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.poster.avif?t=1749105613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.webm?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.mp4?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <u><i><strong>DASH TO DESTROY</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why shoot when you can launch yourself face-first into enemy drones?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement *is* your weapon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/2bd194b78ee69e3e774cdb0440815603.poster.avif?t=1749105613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/2bd194b78ee69e3e774cdb0440815603.webm?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/2bd194b78ee69e3e774cdb0440815603.mp4?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude99 <u><i><strong>COLLECT LUG NUTS</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your score, flex your skills, and spend what you\u2019ve earned  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to unlock voice logs that reveal the factory\u2019s deeper secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/1059b55ef1f7d16ae4d09a7843633803.poster.avif?t=1749105613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/1059b55ef1f7d16ae4d09a7843633803.webm?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/1059b55ef1f7d16ae4d09a7843633803.mp4?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <u><i><strong>R.E.A.C.T.O.R IS VOICED</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It talks. A lot.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes helpful, sometimes creepy \u2014 always judging your performance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced throughout the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.poster.avif?t=1749105613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.webm?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.mp4?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0a <i><strong>THE WORLD</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The factory isn\u2019t broken \u2014 it\u2019s just... overly enthusiastic about quality control. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is a deathtrap with a clipboard. \u2705\ud83d\udc80  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts don\u2019t carry parts \u2014 they carry grudges. \u2699\ufe0f\ud83d\ude24  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights flicker like they\u2019re trying to tell you something... but they won\u2019t make it easy. \ud83d\udca1\ud83e\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And R.E.A.C.T.O.R?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f It\u2019s watching...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc It\u2019s recording...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 It\u2019s definitely *not* rooting for you. Probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <i><strong>FOR FANS OF:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana ZERO</strong> \u2013 fast, precise, brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INSIDE</strong> \u2013 atmospheric, story-driven platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLACK: The Fall</strong> \u2013 industrial sci-fi with oppressive tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ratchet &amp; Clank</strong> \u2013 stylish chaos and character personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive the factory.</i><br> <br><i>Mock the machine. </i>  <br>   <br><i>Don\u2019t stop moving.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe9 <strong><i>WISHLIST NOW</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R.E.A.C.T.O.R is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It knows who doesn\u2019t.)</p>",
