eam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.poster.avif?t=1749105613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.webm?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.mp4?t=1749105613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0a <i><strong>THE WORLD</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The factory isn\u2019t broken \u2014 it\u2019s just... overly enthusiastic about quality control. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is a deathtrap with a clipboard. \u2705\ud83d\udc80  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts don\u2019t carry parts \u2014 they carry grudges. \u2699\ufe0f\ud83d\ude24  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights flicker like they\u2019re trying to tell you something... but they won\u2019t make it easy. \ud83d\udca1\ud83e\udd28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And R.E.A.C.T.O.R?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f It\u2019s watching...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc It\u2019s recording...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 It\u2019s definitely *not* rooting for you. Probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <i><strong>FOR FANS OF:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana ZERO</strong> \u2013 fast, precise, brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INSIDE</strong> \u2013 atmospheric, story-driven platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLACK: The Fall</strong> \u2013 industrial sci-fi with oppressive tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ratchet &amp; Clank</strong> \u2013 stylish chaos and character personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive the factory.</i><br> <br><i>Mock the machine. </i>  <br>   <br><i>Don\u2019t stop moving.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe9 <strong><i>WISHLIST NOW</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R.E.A.C.T.O.R is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It knows who doesn\u2019t.)</p>",
